@startuml sd_us106
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
title US106 - Sequence Diagram
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
actor "Backoffice Operator" as Actor
participant "Entry (Envoy)\nvirtual IP of airports-routes" as EAR
box "airports-routes-n (the replica that answers)" #F7F7F7
participant "AirportController" as AirportController
participant "RegisterAirportUseCase" as RegisterAirportUseCase
database "own database" as DBAR
participant "Outbox dispatcher" as OBAR
end box
collections "peer replicas\nairports-routes-m" as PAR
== POST /api/airports ==
Actor -> EAR : POST /api/airports\n(HTTPS, Authorization: Bearer JWT)
EAR -> AirportController : to a ready replica\n(another one if it fails)
AirportController -> RegisterAirportUseCase : execute(...)
RegisterAirportUseCase -> DBAR : IATA code already in the catalog?
RegisterAirportUseCase -> DBAR : save airport + one copy per other replica in the outbox\n(same transaction)
RegisterAirportUseCase --> AirportController : created
AirportController --> Actor : 201 Created
OBAR -> PAR : PUT /internal/replicas/airports\n(to every other replica, retried until delivered)
PAR --> OBAR : 200 (applied if newer)
@enduml
